; Leg HG -- FreeDOS at 38400, COM2.  NO CONTROL EXISTS; this is discovery.
;
; BENCH take-file: there is no "set line" here.  ~/.kermrc names the adapter.
; CHECK THAT IT NAMES THE ONE THAT IS PLUGGED IN.
;
; MAME cannot drive this machine above about 9600, so nothing anywhere has
; ever run this DOS at this rate.  The readings that matter are rxlost and
; rxfull, not cps.  If it is dirty, HF at 9600 is the fallback position and
; the finding is the rate, not the DOS.
;
; READ IT WITH:
;     python3 v9k/tools/pktstat.py --rxbytes <from STEPHG.OUT> s16bcHG.pkt
; Residual -11 clean, +28 with a startup timeout.
; cmp FIRST, then the counters.  A leg that is fast and wrong is the failure.

set speed 38400
set receive timeout 20
set parity none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
set retry 30
log packets s16bcHG.pkt
send rcvhg.dat
statistics
